            "review_title": "Review at Hai Chua Chicken Rice",
            "review_text": "Lukas Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam218 contributions\n0\nGreat chicken rice\nJul 2016 • Family\nMy friend recommended this place for local chicken rice and so we went there to try it out. My first impression of roasted chicken was WOW. The portion was huge, and you have almost a quarter of the chicken. My wife had boiled chicken, and the portion is the same as well. The rice are quite nice, cooked using the soup from cooking chicken, and the dipping sauce is also unique as well. The price is quite expensive, but the portion may have just make up for it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 2, 2016",
